{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Hey Deborah! Been a few days since we last talked so I wanted to fill you in on something cool. Last Wednesday I did a mini retreat to assess where I'm at in life. It was a dope experience that totally gave me a new outlook."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-f8d7bf4599f9d66e636b0f9a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:11.920875+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f8d7bf4599f9d66e636b0f9a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f8d7bf4599f9d66e636b0f9a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Hey Jolene! Sounds great. Taking time to reflect can be really awesome. Did you gain any new insights from it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-52adbaf122383072beb7556d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:11.940550+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "52adbaf122383072beb7556d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "52adbaf122383072beb7556d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Yep! I achieved so much more than I imagined. It was a real confidence boost."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-6577d6874bc76e9af2d24bd9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:11.943475+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6577d6874bc76e9af2d24bd9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6577d6874bc76e9af2d24bd9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: You deserve credit for stepping outside your comfort zone and believing in yourself. What cool stuff did you accomplish at the retreat?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-f70ed173ef2e2ae2a35c0872", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:11.959372+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f70ed173ef2e2ae2a35c0872", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f70ed173ef2e2ae2a35c0872", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I really accomplished something with my engineering project - I came up with some neat solutions and I'm really excited about it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-3146c1554403a88ae53b9e53", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:11.980625+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3146c1554403a88ae53b9e53", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3146c1554403a88ae53b9e53", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Let's go into more detail."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-9fa1d81ce30d262ccf19343a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:11.992069+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9fa1d81ce30d262ccf19343a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9fa1d81ce30d262ccf19343a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Green tech could really make a difference in disadvantaged areas. I'd like to look into it and see how I can contribute. Hey, speaking of helping out, I had an idea: a volunteer program where engineers teach STEM to underprivileged kids. What do you think of that?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-37cde60a9182dbf3c22622f5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:12.003048+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "37cde60a9182dbf3c22622f5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "37cde60a9182dbf3c22622f5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: That sounds great, Jolene! It's a great way to help and inspire others. They would benefit a lot from your knowledge. Have you thought of a plan yet?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-95dbc43901f51cd51e33229f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:12.013623+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "95dbc43901f51cd51e33229f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "95dbc43901f51cd51e33229f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Haven't finished planning yet but I'm thinking of teaming up with local schools/centers to do workshops. We could even invite engineers as guest speakers to show kids their career options."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-b6cfa7f4faea73b4ab6b0c4c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:12.023606+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b6cfa7f4faea73b4ab6b0c4c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b6cfa7f4faea73b4ab6b0c4c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Having guest speakers, like them, would definitely give the kids a real-world view. Have you reached out to any schools or centers yet?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-a7a8b54d7f9eb79776a7a30d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:12.044197+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a7a8b54d7f9eb79776a7a30d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a7a8b54d7f9eb79776a7a30d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: No, not yet. I want to solidify the plan first. Can't wait to start reaching out, though!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-2ae260ec8640a16a622b54c9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:12.054580+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2ae260ec8640a16a622b54c9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2ae260ec8640a16a622b54c9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: That makes sense. I'm excited to hear how you reach out and help those kids. Let me know how it goes!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-1132980577db1fd8c0055ed7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:12.065961+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1132980577db1fd8c0055ed7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1132980577db1fd8c0055ed7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I'll keep you posted! Appreciate the support! Here are my sketches in the planner."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-46fea29ac021fcefa7f3a491", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:12.070540+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "46fea29ac021fcefa7f3a491", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "46fea29ac021fcefa7f3a491", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Sounds like you're doing great. Let me know if you need more tips or information."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-31e77ad10e7abff055555d11", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:12.088789+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "31e77ad10e7abff055555d11", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "31e77ad10e7abff055555d11", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Thanks, Deb! If I need anything else, I'll let you know. You're awesome!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-d6cc27a897a57a65a410e06b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:12.102575+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d6cc27a897a57a65a410e06b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d6cc27a897a57a65a410e06b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: You're awesome too! Take care!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-4bcf004bf8d81d4e85e99bbc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:12.114345+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4bcf004bf8d81d4e85e99bbc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4bcf004bf8d81d4e85e99bbc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Stay safe!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_5-2a989cd4d28643959e3c9c67", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:12.124047+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2a989cd4d28643959e3c9c67", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2a989cd4d28643959e3c9c67", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
